capability pdf/tables  simple tables: columns, wrapped cells, headers repeated across pages
  heroes  pdf.table, pdf.draw_table, pdf.Table, pdf.Column
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    gofpdf builds tables of Cell calls and ReportLab's platypus Table is a layout engine; here a table is one call that checks every cell before it draws, and goes on to new pages of the same size

